# Compiled binaries. cmd/searchd and cmd/reindex build to names matching their directories.
/searchd
/reindex
/bin/searchd
/bin/reindex

# The contract, fetched by bin/sync-contracts at a pinned tag and commit.
#
# Ignored on purpose, and it is the rule rather than an oversight: kinetix-contracts is the only
# source of a .proto in this estate. `git ls-files '*.proto'` must stay empty here, as it does in
# every other service.
/contracts/

# The generated gRPC stubs in internal/contractgen are committed since 2026-10-26, at the user's choice:
# Dependabot runs `go mod tidy` on a bare clone and cannot run bin/sync-contracts, so with them
# ignored every Go update failed. CI's purity job regenerates them with a pinned protoc and fails
# when they differ from what is committed, so they cannot drift from the contract.

coverage.out
coverage.html

.env
.DS_Store
